<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Listas físicas</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><header><a href="/">← Panel</a><b>Listas físicas</b></header><main><h1>Venta en papel</h1><p>Bloquea una letra completa antes de imprimir. Una letra con reservas o ventas digitales no se puede bloquear.</p><p class="alert">No desbloquees una letra hasta recuperar y conciliar la hoja física. Las ventas físicas pendientes deben registrarse antes de habilitarla.</p><% if(message){ %><p class="alert"><%= message %></p><% } %><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Letra</th><th>Ocupados</th><th>Responsable</th><th>Acción</th></tr></thead><tbody><% letters.forEach(x=>{ %><tr><td><b><%= x.letter %></b></td><td><%= x.occupied %></td><td><%= x.responsible||'Digital' %></td><td><% if(x.responsible){ %><a class="button small" href="/admin/fisicas/<%= x.letter %>/imprimir" target="_blank">Imprimir</a> <form class="inline" method="post" action="/admin/fisicas/<%= x.letter %>/unblock" onsubmit="return confirm('¿Ya recuperaste la lista física y registraste todas sus ventas?')"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="small secondary">Desbloquear</button></form><% }else if(x.occupied===0){ %><form method="post" action="/admin/fisicas/<%= x.letter %>/block"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input name="responsible" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Nombre familiar responsable"><button class="small">Bloquear</button></form><% }else{ %>Ya tiene movimientos<% } %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><section class="panel"><h2>Registrar venta de hoja física</h2><form method="post" id="physicalSale"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Letra bloqueada<select name="letter" id="physicalLetter" required><% letters.filter(x=>x.responsible).forEach(x=>{ %><option value="<%= x.letter %>"><%= x.letter %> · <%= x.responsible %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Número (1 a 100)<input name="number" type="number" min="1" max="100" required></label><label>Comprador<input name="buyer_name" minlength="2" maxlength="120" required></label><label>Teléfono<input name="buyer_phone" minlength="5" maxlength="40" required></label><label>Estado<select name="paid"><option value="yes">Pagado</option><option value="no">Reservado</option></select></label><button>Registrar número</button></form></section></main><script>document.getElementById('physicalSale').addEventListener('submit',function(e){let l=document.getElementById('physicalLetter').value;if(!l){e.preventDefault();alert('Primero bloquea una letra');return;}this.action='/admin/fisicas/'+l+'/sale';});</script></body></html>